    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tkicbre",
      "content": "Management of Nursing Services and Education deals with the planning, organizing, staffing, directing, and controlling of nursing services in healthcare settings. It ensures that patient care is delivered efficiently and effectively. Nursing management also includes nursing education, leadership, supervision, and evaluation of nursing personnel. In nursing competitive examinations such as RRB Nursing, questions are frequently asked about management principles, leadership styles, hospital organization, staffing patterns, supervision, and quality assurance."
    },
